    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Context:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins have snuck into our world from all sorts of books, movies, and games! Grab them all before they get up to too many shenanigans! This game is short and cozy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431410/extras/f59c31ce26895a8c275e20c4a6082a09.poster.avif?t=1729639401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431410/extras/f59c31ce26895a8c275e20c4a6082a09.webm?t=1729639401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431410/extras/f59c31ce26895a8c275e20c4a6082a09.mp4?t=1729639401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 5 Hand drawn stages with unique artsyles and sizes! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd0f 250+ Unique goblins to grab! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Custom Soundtrack for each stage! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0dHandy hint button! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Time trial mode for each stage! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc44 Mouth made SFX!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left click to grab a goblin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right click and move the mouse to pan (on the larger stages)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Spacebar' to point to the nearest goblin </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Context:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins have snuck into our world from all sorts of books, movies, and games! Grab them all before they get up to too many shenanigans! This game is short and cozy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431410/extras/f59c31ce26895a8c275e20c4a6082a09.poster.avif?t=1729639401\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431410/extras/f59c31ce26895a8c275e20c4a6082a09.webm?t=1729639401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431410/extras/f59c31ce26895a8c275e20c4a6082a09.mp4?t=1729639401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 5 Hand drawn stages with unique artsyles and sizes! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd0f 250+ Unique goblins to grab! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Custom Soundtrack for each stage! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0dHandy hint button! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Time trial mode for each stage! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc44 Mouth made SFX!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left click to grab a goblin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right click and move the mouse to pan (on the larger stages)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Spacebar' to point to the nearest goblin </p></li></ul>",
